  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-41302-IP24-VNM826</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41302" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Labour Organization (ILO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deepened commitment to ratify and apply international labour standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Viet Nam&#x2019;s constituents have made notable efforts to strengthen the application and promotion of International Labour Standards (ILS), with a particular focus on fundamental principles and rights at work. Recent ILO support has included facilitating the ratification process and ensuring the timely submission of regular reports on ratified conventions.

During this biennium, the ILO is assisting Viet Nam in several key areas: raising public awareness of the importance of ILS&#x2014;particularly fundamental conventions; supporting the ratification and integration of ILO conventions into national frameworks; strengthening national capacity for effective implementation; and ensuring the timely submission of high-quality reports on their application. This includes closely monitoring progress and responding appropriately to the international supervisory mechanisms.

Key national institutions&#x2014;especially the government and social partners (employers&apos; and workers&apos; organizations)&#x2014;benefit from this support through enhanced capacity to implement and monitor international labour standards.</narrative>
  </description>
